logos-nogo: static-analysis helper (module logos/nogo)
=====================================================

Copyright 2019-2026 The gVisor Authors. All rights reserved.

This module ports the gVisor nogo driver, its six custom analyzers, and its
analyzer registry to the loGos toolchain. The original sources live in the
gVisor reference tree (.references/gvisor, Apache License 2.0); every ported
file keeps its original copyright header and per-file provenance note.
The full license text is in LICENSE.apache-2.0 in this directory.

